    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_ack",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "A persuasive case becomes stronger when it acknowledges the most reasonable objection rather than pretending none exists."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک استدلال قانع‌کننده وقتی قوی‌تر می‌شه که منطقی‌ترین ایراد رو بپذیره، نه اینکه وانمود کنه ایرادی وجود نداره."
        },
        "intent": "acknowledge_objection",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_persuasive",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_acknowledge",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_objection"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_concession",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would make one concession here: the proposal is costly in the short term, even if the longer-term case remains compelling."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اینجا یک نکته رو می‌پذیرم: پیشنهاد در کوتاه‌مدت پرهزینه‌ست، حتی اگر استدلال بلندمدتش همچنان خیلی قانع‌کننده باشه."
        },
        "intent": "make_concession",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_concession",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_compelling"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_counter",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "The strongest counterargument is not that the goal is wrong, but that the proposed mechanism may create a new problem."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "قوی‌ترین استدلال مخالف این نیست که هدف غلطه، بلکه اینه که سازوکار پیشنهادی ممکنه مشکل جدیدی ایجاد کنه."
        },
        "intent": "state_counterargument",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_counterargument",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_objection"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_credibility",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Our credibility depends on distinguishing what we know from what we merely hope will happen."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اعتبار ما به این بستگی داره که چیزی رو که می‌دونیم از چیزی که فقط امیدواریم اتفاق بیفته جدا کنیم."
        },
        "intent": "protect_credibility",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_credibility"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_appeal",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "An emotional appeal may attract attention, but it should not replace evidence where the decision has serious consequences."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "استدلال احساسی ممکنه توجه جلب کنه، ولی جایی که تصمیم پیامد جدی داره نباید جای شواهد رو بگیره."
        },
        "intent": "evaluate_appeal",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_appeal",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_credibility"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_frame",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would frame the recommendation around the shared objective, then explain why this option handles the trade-offs better."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "توصیه رو حول هدف مشترک قاب‌بندی می‌کنم و بعد توضیح می‌دم چرا این گزینه تعارض‌ها رو بهتر مدیریت می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "frame_persuasion",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_persuasion_concession_persuasive",
          "c1_persuasion_concession_compelling"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_limit",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The case is compelling within these constraints; I would avoid presenting it as universally applicable."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "در این محدودیت‌ها استدلال خیلی قانع‌کننده‌ست؛ ولی به‌عنوان نسخه‌ای برای همه جا مطرحش نمی‌کنم."
        },
        "intent": "limit_claim",
        "concept_refs": [
