        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_persuasion_concession_close",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-persuasion-concession-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "If we address the objection directly, the audience can disagree with our judgment without doubting that we have considered the alternatives."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر مستقیم به ایراد پاسخ بدیم، مخاطب می‌تونه با قضاوت ما مخالف باشه بدون اینکه فکر کنه گزینه‌های دیگه رو ندیده‌ایم."
        },
        "intent": "close_persuasion",
